The vehicle surfaces in geometry/ are voxel-wrapped derivatives of third-party
models published on Sketchfab under Creative Commons Attribution. They are
redistributed here under those same terms, with credit to their authors:

    AUTOW.stl   Low Poly Autorickshaw aka TukTuk, by Nirmal.Justin
    WAGONR.stl  2013 Suzuki WagonR, by BHP3D
    DZIRE.stl   2022 Maruti Suzuki Swift Dzire, by BHP3D

Model links and licence provenance are recorded in geometry/README.md.
